```

The [coverage list](/home/smoke01/dev/ancient-games/code_map/eval/COVERAGE.md) gives all 18 exercised Fails-if lines verbatim and their case IDs.

NOT CHECKED:

- **A6:** “fewer than three modules are mapped, or a map fails A1” — no opencode cases supplied.
- **L2:** “it leaves out correctness, the build cost, the reading tokens or the time, or hides a worse result” — measured by P5.

Agent behaviour assigned to P6 and R3’s broader privacy promise remain explicitly unchecked. `unshare -rn` worked here.

These checks were authored by Codex and passed against the stub; they do not establish correctness of the future tool. Reports: [JSON](/tmp/cm-eval/report.json), [Markdown](/tmp/cm-eval/report.md).
